## ✅ Phase 1: Quick Wins - **COMPLETE**

### 1. Chart Export Module
**File**: [chart-export.js](file:///C:/Users/samsung/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/solar-pv-calculator/chart-export.js)

**Features**:
- Convert Chart.js canvases to base64 PNG images
- Capture all charts for Word/PDF embedding
- Individual chart download as PNG
- Automatic image tag generation for documents

**Usage**:
```javascript
const images = await ChartExporter.captureAllCharts();
const scatterImg = ChartExporter.createImageTag(images.scatterChart, 600);
```

### 2. CSV Export Module
**File**: [csv-export.js](file:///C:/Users/samsung/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/solar-pv-calculator/csv-export.js)

**Features**:
- Export monthly performance data to CSV
- Export annual summary statistics
- Complete report export (all sections)
- Automatic file download with timestamps

**Usage**:
```javascript
CSVExporter.exportMonthlyData();       // Monthly table
CSVExporter.exportAnnualSummary();     // Annual stats
CSVExporter.exportCompleteReport();    // Everything
```

### 3. System Presets Module
**File**: [presets.js](file:///C:/Users/samsung/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/solar-pv-calculator/presets.js)

**Features**:
- 7 pre-configured system types:
  - Residential Small (3 kWp)
  - Residential Medium (5 kWp)
  - Residential Large (10 kWp)
  - Commercial Small (50 kWp)
  - Commercial Medium (250 kWp)
  - Utility Scale (1 MWp)
  - Single-Axis Tracking (500 kWp)
- Save custom presets to localStorage
- Load/delete saved configurations

**Usage**:
```javascript
SystemPresets.loadPreset('residential-medium');
SystemPresets.saveCustomPreset('MyProject');
```

