## ✅ Phase 3: Financial Analysis - **COMPLETE**

### 5. Financial Calculator Module
**File**: [financial-calculator.js](file:///C:/Users/samsung/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/solar-pv-calculator/financial-calculator.js)

**Comprehensive financial modeling with all standard metrics**:

**Calculations Implemented**:
1. **ROI** (Return on Investment) with degradation
2. **Simple Payback Period**
3. **Discounted Payback Period**
4. **NPV** (Net Present Value) - full DCF model
5. **IRR** (Internal Rate of Return) - Newton-Raphson solver
6. **LCOE** (Levelized Cost of Energy)
7. **Lifetime Savings** with electricity price escalation
8. **Year-by-year cashflow analysis** (30 years)
9. **Federal Tax Credit** (ITC) calculation
10. **State incentives** integration

**Features**:
- Electricity price escalation over time
- Annual degradation modeling (0.5% typical)
- Operation & Maintenance costs
- Present value discounting
- Sensitivity to discount rates

**Usage**:
```javascript
const financials = FinancialCalculator.calculateMetrics({
    systemCost: 15000,        // $15k system
    annualProduction: 7000,   // 7000 kWh/year
    electricityRate: 0.12,    // $0.12/kWh
    escalationRate: 3,        // 3% annual increase
    discountRate: 5,          // 5% discount
    systemLifetime: 25,       // 25 years
    maintenanceCost: 100,     // $100/year O&M
    degradationRate: 0.5,     // 0.5%/year
    federalTaxCredit: 30,     // 30% ITC
    stateTaxCredit: 1000      // $1000 state rebate
});

console.log(financials.npv);          // Net present value
console.log(financials.irr);          // Internal rate of return
console.log(financials.simplePayback); // Years to payback
```

